                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is riddled with weird level designs making you scratch your head and question your purchase. How can you release a game in this state??? Ufff...... this 2 d side scrolling beat em up  builds up the '' Raging Fist'' to punch through your computer screen as its cookie cutter gameplay and unbearable loud music screams into your ears.  I am quite glad to see no sequel from the devs as the mixed reviews say it all. \r\n\r\nThe only saving grace is its graphics and its just about fine gameplay which gets a bit boring when you are fighting enemies lacking variety throughout the game.\r\n\r\nI did play the 1st of Dusty Revenge series and it piqued my interest to go for the second.But lo and behold.... you give me this stinking pile of garbage and you expect me to play it ?? Come on, PD Studio.",
